alse\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Applying the above recipe, we get the following phase line for our differential equation.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-97930-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-97930-a-1\"></div>\n</div></div>",
